            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda akoba ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo boonaboona abakola ebisinzibwa ebitali Katonda bali agho batyo, bazira kye bagasa naire. N'ebisinzibwa byaibwe ebyo ebibeesiimisa, biziramu muganhulo. N'abo ababisinza batulu beene, era tibaidhi ng'ekyo kye bakola kisobola okubaleetera okuswala obuswale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ole akola ekifaananie n'akyeta katonda oba n'akiwumba obuwumbe, aba adaagiire bwereere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli alikisinza ensoni dhirimugema, kuba abakola ebifaananie ebyo bantu buntu. Bagwaine boonaboona babaleete babeemereze ghalala, bawozesebwe. Memale olwo batye era baswazibweswazibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugheesi bw'aba ali kugheesa ekifaananie ekisinzibwa, atoola ekyuma yaakifuguta mu manda ag'omuliro, yaagema enhundo mu ngalo dhe edh'amaani yaakikonta okukitereeza. Bweyeeyongera okuja ng'akola atyo, endhala emuluma, yaakoogha, era bw'atanhwa ku maadhi awaamu amaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ate omubaadhi apima omuti n'olukoba, yaagulambaku n'ekalaamu. Yaagulanda n'eranda, era yaagulambaku n'ekyuma ekipima, yaagukolamu ekifaananie ekirungi kyene ekiri ng'oti muntu, eky'okuteebwa mu isabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asobola okutema omuvule mu kibira yaakozesa ogwo, oba yaakozesa omusipuressi, oba omuti omukologho ogundi. Oba yaasimba omuti ogundi, amaadhi gaagwa gaagukuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "WIS.13.11+WIS.13.12+WIS.13.13+WIS.13.14+WIS.13.15+WIS.13.16+WIS.13.17+WIS.13.18+WIS.13.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mag 13:11-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omuntu oyo atoola ku muti gw'atemye yaakolamu ekisinzibwa ekitali Katonda, era ekifaananie ekyo ekibaadhe yaakikubira amakiryaivu, yaakisinza. Bw'amala, omuti ogusigairegho agufuulamu nku, yaatwala yaakumisa omuliro, yaayota yaasuugha, era yaafumbisa n'emere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enku edhindi adhikumisa omuliro yaatalika emamba, yaalya yaiguta. Era yaayota omuliro, yaamala yaakoba ati: “Ha, akaliro akalungi kansuuyiiza!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitundu kire ekindi eky'omuti akikolamu ekisinzibwa, yaakikubira amakiryaivu, yaakisinza ng'akoba ati: “Nkweghembye mponia, kuba niiwe katonda wange!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abo bazira kye baidhi era bazira kye balowooza kikalamu. Baaziba amaiso gaibwe n'emyoyo gyaibwe, baaloba kubona waire okutegeera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu akola ekisinzibwa ekitali Katonda, taidhukira waire okwefumintirizaaku mule ati: “Ekitundu ky'omuti ogwo nkikumiisa omuliro naagufumbisa emere, era naatalikaku n'emamba naagirya. Memale obwo ekitundu kyagwo ekisigairegho ate kye nnaafuula ekisinzibwa ekyenhinhalwa, era ni nkikubira n'amakiryaivu, ate nga kiti buti?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu oyo ali ng'oti n'ole alya eivu. Aba yeerimbye era ng'adaaliimye, nga takaasobola kuwonia bulamu bwe, waire okwebuuzaaku mule ati: “Ekifaananie kye ngemye mu ngalo dhange ti kya buguya bwereere?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
